Scope

* The code in code/ (map generator, simulator, unit tests and evaluation
  script) is released under the MIT licence above.
* The corpus (corpus/: the Chinese instructions, their ground-truth command
  sequences and the fixed start poses), the prompt files (prompt/) and the
  figure in docs/ are released under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
  International licence (CC BY 4.0),
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/.
* The raw outputs of the third-party models (output/) are NOT covered by these
  licences; they remain subject to the terms of use of their respective
  providers. See NOTICE.md.
